# Hard exclusions — this is a PUBLIC repo. Nothing private may ever be committed.
# Only roots, per-leaf hashes, RFC-3161 tokens, public keys, and docs belong here.

# Never commit any raw source data, report bodies, or evidence
*.pdf
*.eml
*.csv
evidence/
out/
raw/

# Never commit private keys or secrets
*.key
*.pem.private
*private*.pem
.env
.env.*
secrets*

# Never commit the private manifests / specs / methodology
*MANIFEST*
*SOURCE*
*DIGEST*
*EVIDENCE-SPEC*
*INVENTORY*
*PLAYBOOK*

# OS / editor noise
.DS_Store
*.swp
*~

# Allowed public keys are placed explicitly under keys/ as *.pub.pem
!keys/*.pub.pem
